  message: "2026-10-25 (owner-requested note, from a review of how WI-ziruv and WI-kosup bear on the open concept-audit rows): Named instance in WI-kosup section D: _RECEIVER_MARKERS is a hand-written subset of meta['receiver'] that did not grow with it. The fix here does NOT wait for the sweep. The structural fix (structural-fix protocol) places EVERY receiver value in or out of the set, with a test that fails when a new value is unplaced, not only adding declared_type. The proposed partition gate WI-kosup files is the general form."  # bd26
